## Key architecture patterns to preserve

### Hot path (WS-driven, ~1s latency)
```
ws_feed.py → price_change event → main.py:hot_requote() → quoter → order_manager
```
- Debounce: 1s minimum between requotes per market
- Velocity guard: skip if 3 ticks moved in 5s

### Cold path (cycle-based, 10s)
```
main.py:run_cycle() → market_manager → quoter → order_manager → fill_collector → scoring_monitor
```
- REBALANCE_INTERVAL_SECONDS=10 (configurable)
- Smart-diff: only replace order if price moved > THRESHOLD ticks OR size changed > 10% OR age > MAX_ORDER_AGE_SECONDS

### Skew protection (4 tiers, inventory.py:248-285)
- Alert: 25% → log warning
- Action: 30% → widen bid offset
- Recovery: 45% → reduce ASK size 50%
- Hard pause: 70% → stop quoting this market

